   ```latex
   % SDF LaTeX Package Commands
   \sdfproblem{Define the specific research question...}
   \sdfinsight{Our key discovery is...}
   \sdfmethod{We employed approach X...}
   \sdfresult{Results demonstrate...}
   \sdflimitation{This study has limitations...}
   \sdfreproducibility{Data available at...}

   % Environment for experiments
   \begin{sdfexperiment}{experiment001}
     \protocol{...}
     \datafile{data.csv}
   \end{sdfexperiment}
   ```

   - Custom LaTeX package (sdf.sty) for Overleaf/local use
   - Compiler that extracts SDF metadata from TeX
   - PDF generation with embedded machine-readable metadata
   - Import existing LaTeX projects and auto-tag sections

